Subject: [PATCH 067/230] Restructure Matchday feed: date-grouped upcoming,
 show-more toggle, default-open previous, single ad slot

- Group upcoming matches by kickoff date with sticky "Today / Tomorrow / weekday, Oct 12" headers
- Replace hard cap with a 6-card default + Show more / Show less toggle for upcoming
- Open Previous results by default and cap at 6 instead of 12
- Remove the bottom Predictions link (already in Profile + bottom nav)
- Keep one ad placement only, between Upcoming and Previous (remove empty-feed ad)
- Add formatDayHeader() helper for the date labels (EN + FA)
- Drop unused imports/state (ChartIcon, ChevronRightIcon, capGeneral, upcomingShown)

Co-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
